      "text": "Hm?"
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "start_time": 3.71,
      "end_time": 6.21,
      "text": "Christina here, returning from duty!"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "start_time": 6.7,
      "end_time": 9.31,
      "text": "Let's hear a fine welcome!"
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "start_time": 9.7,
      "end_time": 14.06,
      "text": "Christina! I heard what you did!"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "start_time": 14.65,
      "end_time": 16.89,
      "text": "What the heck were you thinking?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "start_time": 16.85,
      "end_time": 18.06,
      "text": "Plotting against Caon,"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "start_time": 18.16,
      "end_time": 20.57,
      "text": "and even attacking their guildhouse?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "start_time": 20.78,
      "end_time": 24.83,
      "text": "It's outright villainy! Is that how a knight behaves?!"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "start_time": 25.45,
      "end_time": 29.37,
      "text": "Oh my. Jumping straight to the verbal assault?"
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "start_time": 29.4,
      "end_time": 32.8,
      "text": "At least welcome me home first, why don't you?"
    }
  ],
